      "order": 0,
      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-03-007\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4317]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>BORDERLINE OVARIAN TUMORS (</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>BOT</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>)</strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4318]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Tumors of low malignant potential.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4319]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>More in young Pts.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4320]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>10 \u2013 1</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5% of all epitheli</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>al ovarian neoplasm.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4321]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5-year survival:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4322]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Stage I = 95 \u2013 97%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4323]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'>Stage II = 50 \u2013 86%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4324]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>10 years\u2019 survival 70 \u2013 80%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4325]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Risk Factor: </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4326]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>S</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ame as Epithelial tumors</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4327]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FF0000; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt'>Ser</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FF0000; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 8pt'>ous neoplasia</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>N</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>o association with BRCA</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4328]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>p53 mutation = invasive neoplasia </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4329]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>KRAs/BRAF = BOT.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4330]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No progression from 1 form to other.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4331]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>B</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>OT</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> can be invasive but low Grade.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4332]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Histopathology:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4333]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Serous.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4334]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mucinous.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4335]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Endometrial. </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4336]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Serous:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4337]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Most common 50%.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4338]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Micropapillary</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4339]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Micro invasive.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4340]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Mucinous:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4341]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>46%</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4342]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Intestinal</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4343]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><em><strong>Endometrial:</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4344]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bru</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>ner.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4345]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Clear.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4346]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mixed.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4347]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Histological features of BOT:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4348]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Stratified epithelium.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4349]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Varying degree of Atypia.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4350]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> Ed mitotic activity.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4351]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Lack of stromal invasion (distinguishing feature).</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4352]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Symptoms:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4353]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Asymptomatic </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4354]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pelvic pain \u2013 long duration than invasive.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4355]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Bloating</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4356]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Menstrual</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> irregularity.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4357]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pressure symptoms.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4358]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CA \u2013 125:</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4359]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Raised in 75% serous and 30% of mucinous tumors.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4360]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>CA 19 \u2013 9: </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4361]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Mucinous.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4362]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>TVS: variation in appearance.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4363]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Doppler: differentiate between benign ad malignant intracystic blood flow.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4364]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Management:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4365]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>BOT</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4366]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Referral to cancer </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>center</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4367]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>Fertility wishes</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4368]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>Yes</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>Early stage</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u><strong>Conservative surgery:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><strong>1.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> unilateral </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Saplingoopherectomy</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> + sparing of other tube + ovary + uterus.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><strong>2.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Peritoneal </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>washings.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><strong>3.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Biopsy.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><strong>4.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> omentectomy.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><strong>5.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> lymphadenectomy.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u><strong>Completion Surgery in case of:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>- Recurrence.</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>- Pt request after completion of family.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4369]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>No </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4370]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>Standard </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4371]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>Advance</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>Stage</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>Invasive implants</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Yes </strong></span><span class=\"mm-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>       No</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>management</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4372]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>Stating </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4373]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>laparotomy</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4374]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>1.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> TAH + BSO.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4375]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>2.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> O</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>me</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>ntectom</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>y</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4376]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>3.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> peritoneal </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4377]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>washings</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4378]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>4.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> Biopsy from </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4379]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>suspected area</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>s</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4380]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>5.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> Appendectomy</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4381]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> in case of mucinous</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4382]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><strong>6.</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u>+</u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> lymphadenectomy </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4383]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>(NR) </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>No role in survival </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4384]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>only to stage the dx so</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4385]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>not recommended</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> routinely.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4386]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4387]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>Follow up:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4388]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>Exam</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>ination</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> + TVS.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4389]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>- 3 monthly </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>for</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> 2yrs.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4390]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>- 6 monthly </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>for </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>next</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>2yrs</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4391]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>- Annually \u2013 after w</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>ards</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4392]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'>- </span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4393]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u><strong>carry out Frozen section where possible:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4394]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4395]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>1/3</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><sup>rd</sup></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'> invasive on H/P.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4396]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4397]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'>Referral to oncology MDT</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4398]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4399]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u><strong>      </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 9pt'><u><strong>Restaging </strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4400]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 11pt'><u><strong>Recurrence</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong> </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt'><u><strong>8 \u2013 73%.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4401]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Relapse:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4402]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>with invasive implants \u2013 21% over 5 years.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4403]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>with non \u2013 invasive implants 2%.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4404]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>DNA aneuploidy </strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>19-fold</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>     in invasive implants.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4405]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>12 \u2013 58% after cystectomy.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4406]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>0 \u2013 20% after USO/BSO.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4407]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>2.5 \u2013 5.7% after completion surgery.</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4408]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Restaging</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong> depends upon</strong></u></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4409]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Aneuploidy status \u2013 DNA.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4410]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Micro papillary status.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4411]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Invasive implants.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4412]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>No fertility concerns.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4413]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><u><strong>Fertility in BOT:</strong></u></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4414]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Conservative Treatment.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[4415]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>S</sp